  "announcement_github_body": "# dalgona 0.1.0\n\n## Install dalgona 0.1.0\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgona-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via powershell script\n\n```sh\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c \"irm https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgona-installer.ps1 | iex\"\n```\n\n## Download dalgona 0.1.0\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [dalgona-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgona-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgona-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [dalgona-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgona-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgona-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [dalgona-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgona-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | ARM64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgona-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\n| [dalgona-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgona-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | x64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgona-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\n| [dalgona-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgona-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | ARM64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgona-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [dalgona-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgona-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgona-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n\n# dalgon 0.1.0\n\n## Install dalgon 0.1.0\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgon-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via powershell script\n\n```sh\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -c \"irm https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgon-installer.ps1 | iex\"\n```\n\n## Download dalgon 0.1.0\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [dalgon-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgon-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgon-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [dalgon-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgon-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgon-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [dalgon-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgon-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | ARM64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgon-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\n| [dalgon-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgon-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | x64 Windows | [checksum](https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgon-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\n| [dalgon-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/gosuda/dalgona/releases/download/v0.1.0/dalgon-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | ARM64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/g